      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long greets it inside the Earth Trench formation. Narration names Evil Dragon Di Zang Sheng as an immemorial desolate beast created from endless hatred, anger, and grudges in Central Continent’s earth veins, born of nature with intelligence that matches humans. It laughs that Duke Long is dying and lifespan Gu cannot save him. Duke Long extracts life essence from it through the formation he personally created, recovering from a frail state while Di Zang Sheng cries out in pain.",
      "chapters": [
        1301
      ],
